msgid ""
"Cada parte es una partitura (PDF) de un instrumento. \"Cargar parte\" sube "
"una nueva; \"Adjuntar parte suelta\" suma una que ya subiste para otra obra "
"o quedó huérfana. Sólo el dueño de cada parte puede editarla, separarla "
"(queda suelta, sin borrarla) o borrarla."
msgstr ""
"Each part is one instrument's score (PDF). \"Upload part\" adds a new one; "
"\"Attach loose part\" adds one you already uploaded for another piece or "
"that was left orphaned. Only each part's owner can edit it, detach it (it "
"becomes loose, not deleted) or delete it."

