msgstr ""
"fills in the selection's measures with no real mark by spreading the time "
"between the nearest explicit marks — if a stretch's two anchors ended up "
"with reversed real time (a contradictory tap), it won't interpolate there "
"and flags which one it is, instead of saving a time that would go "
"backward;"

