"tiempo invertido, sin tener que buscarlo a mano."
msgstr ""
"\"Select all\" selects the whole piece — combined with Interpolate, this "
"also works as an end-to-end check for any tapped mark that ended up with "
"reversed time, instead of having to hunt for it by hand."

